es and Aaron, who were standing there to meet them when they came forth from Pharaoh.","tok":[{"t":"And they came upon "},{"t":"Moses","s":["H4872"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Aaron","s":["H0175"],"a":[4]},{"t":", who were standing there to meet them when they came "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3318"],"a":[7]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":21,"text":"And they said to them, Jehovah look upon you and judge, because you have made us odious in the sight of Pharaoh and in the sight of his servants so as to put a sword in their hand to kill us.","tok":[{"t":"And they "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to them, "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"look","s":["H7200"],"a":[2]},{"t":" upon you and "},{"t":"judge","s":["H8199"],"a":[5]},{"t":", because you have made us odious in the sight of "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[11]},{"t":" and in the sight of his "},{"t":"servants","s":["H5650"],"a":[13]},{"t":" so as to "},{"t":"put","s":["H5414"],"a":[14]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[15]},{"t":" in their "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[16]},{"t":" to kill us."}]},{"n":22,"text":"Then Moses went back to Jehovah and said, Lord, why have You mistreated this people? Why is it that You have sent me?","tok":[{"t":"Then "},{"t":"Moses","s":["H4872"],"a":[1]},{"t":" went back to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[5]},{"t":", why have You mistreated this "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[8]},{"t":"? Why is it that You have "},{"t":"sent","s":["H7971"],"a":[12]},{"t":" me?"}]},{"n":23,"text":"Ever since I came to Pharaoh to speak in Your name, he has mistreated this people, and You have not delivered Your people at all.","tok":[{"t":"Ever since I "},{"t":"came","s":["H0935"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in Your "},{"t":